From e645356997a6fb327522cb4f47708ef94bd04bda Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:53:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/15] fix: validate generated media responses and missing
 URIs

Preserve audio configuration ordering and backchannel entries while generating profiles. Format integral SOAP values without scientific notation and reject URI requests without a configured endpoint.

Fixes: 2f098ae69cb6 ("feat: enumerate configured media profiles without a two-stream limit")
Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
---
 conf.c              |  3 ++-
 media_profiles.c    | 43 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 soap.c              |  3 ++-
 test/test_cgi.py    | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 test/test_schema.py |  8 ++++++++
 5 files changed, 77 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

